ay-to-day athletics equipment operations, with particular emphasis on protective athletic equipment, football equipment services, practice and competition suppo... View Details Bookmark Grounds Worker - #003348, #221861, #003339 Facilities Management SHRA Position Library 09/14/2026 No Building Environmental Technician The primary location of this position is on-site in Cullowhee, NCThe positions tasks and responsibilities includes, but are not limited to: application of fertilizers, insecticides and herbicides; tree and shrub pruning; maintenance of flowering plants, shrubs and trees; mowing/weedeating of large turf areas; operation of tools,equipment and machinery utilized in grounds maintenance, landscape ... View Details Bookmark Housekeeper - #003678 University Housing SHRA Position Library 09/20/2026 No Building Environmental Technician The primary location of this position is on the main Cullowhee, NC campus.This position will perform a variety of duties in the care and cleaning of Residential Living facilities. Duties include but are not limited to:Moving furniture.Operating heavy cleaning equipment such as a floor scrubber/buffer, carpet extractor, wet/dry vacuum, and/or others as necessary.Following the guidelines set by t... View Details Bookmark Scrub Team (2nd Shift) - #221787 Facilities Management SHRA Position Library 09/21/2026 No Building Environmental Technician The primary location of this position is on the main Cullowhee, NC campus.The primary purpose of this position is to provide Housekeeping floor maintenance for university academic and administrative floor space that may include cleaning, stripping, waxing, buffing, carpet cleaning, etc.; perform physically demanding work including lifting and moving of heavy equipment, furniture, and supplies, ... View Details Bookmark Paint Crew Supervisor - #003567 University Housing SHRA Position Library 10/01/2026 No Facility Maint Tech-Bldg Trade The primary location of this position is on-site at the main Cullowhee, NC campus.This position is responsible for the coordination of all painting activities undertaken bythe Department of Residential Living.This position will be responsible for, but not limitedto the following:Recruiting, interviewing, hiring, training, and managing and retention of a student paint crew of between 10 and 30 s... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Student Financial Aid - #270017 Student Financial Aid EHRA Non Faculty Position Library Yes Assistant Director The primary location of this position is on-site in Cullowhee, NC. This position is designated as being exempt from the State of North Carolina Human Resources Act (EHRA).The primary purpose of this position is to serve as a comprehensive and helpful resource for prospective and current students, their families, and other associated individuals. This role involves delivering exceptional custome... View Details Bookmark Housekeeper Temporary - #T00836 Facilities Management Temp/Hourly 09/30/2026 No Primary duties are physically demanding housekeeping duties in large academic, administrative and athletic buildings. Areas cleaned/disinfected may include auditoriums, classrooms, laboratories, offices, hallways, restrooms, locker rooms, stairways, athletics areas, etc. Duties performed include but are not limited to building unlocking/locking buildings, operating heavy cleaning equipment, rem... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Development/Catamount Club - #251078 Office, Assistant VC of Development EHRA Non Faculty Position Library Yes Assistant Director The primary location of this position is on-site at the Cullowhee, NC campus. This position is designated as being exempt from the State of North Carolina Human Resources Act (EHRA).Are you passionate about collegiate athletics and inspired by the power of philanthropy to elevate the student-athlete experience? Western Carolina University invites applications for a dynamic and driven individual... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Athletics Compliance - #270016 Office of Athletic Programs SHRA Position Library 09/08/2026 No University Program Associate The primary location of this position is on-site in Cullowhee, NC. This position is designated as being subject to the State of North Carolina Human Resources Act (SHRA).The primary purpose of this position is to coordinate and support assigned athletics compliance processes under the direction of the Assistant Athletic Director/Director of Compliance. The position assists with compliance monit... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Communication - Public Relations - #000555 Communication Faculty Position Library Yes Assistant Professor The primary location of this position is on-site in Cullowhee, NC.The Department of Communication at Western Carolina University (WCU) is seeking a full-time, tenure-track, assistant professor of communication position with a primary focus in public relations and strategic communication. This is a nine-month position with an expected begin work date of August 2027.  Duties will include teaching... View Details Bookmark Research Assistant #T00544 Biology Temp/Hourly 12/31/2026 No Employees will assist with research on the federally endangered dusky gopher frog, Rana sevosa. Duties include:1. Capturing and caring for gopher frogs and species that interact with gopher frogs (including other amphibians, tortoises, snakes, rodents, fishes, insects, zooplankton, phytoplankton, and plants) in the field and in outdoor and indoor research facilities.2. Measuring, weighing, mark... View Details Bookmark Deputy Chief Information Security Officer - #270015 IT Security Office EHRA Non Faculty Position Library Yes Deputy Chief Security Information Officer The primary location of this position is on-site in Cullowhee, NC. This position is designated as being exempt from the State of North Carolina Human Resources Act (EHRA).The Deputy Chief Information Security Officer (Deputy CISO) reports to the Chief Information Security & Privacy Officer. The position provides senior operational and program leadership for the IT Security Office and serves... View Details Bookmark Assistant Strength and Conditioning Coach - #270014 Office of Athletic Programs EHRA Non Faculty Position Library Yes Assistant Coach The primary location of this position is on-site in Cullowhee, NC. This position is designated as being exempt from the State of North Carolina Human Resources Act (EHRA)Primary responsibility is overseeing the athletic development of Women’s Basketball, Women’s Soccer, and Women’s Tennis. Will also assist with Football as needed. Candidate must be able to work well within a team setting as wel... View Details Bookmark University Library Technician - #270013 Content Org and Mgt, eRes, & Tech SHRA Position Library 09/06/2026 No University Library Technician The primary location of this position is on-site in Cullowhee, NC. This position is subject to the State of North Carolina Human Resources Act (SHRA).The University Library Technician provides services which are part of the overall mission of Special Collections to acquire, arrange and describe, and provide access to its unique or rare research materials, consisting of manuscripts collections, ... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Practice - Counseling - #192772 Human Services Faculty Position Library Yes Assistant Professor - Practice The primary location of this position is on the Biltmore Park campus in Asheville, NC.Western Carolina University’s (WCU) Department of Human Services invites applications for a 9-month, fixed-term faculty position as Assistant Professor of Practice in Counseling in the graduate Counseling program geographically based in Asheville, NC. Anticipated starting work date is January 1, 2027 (or Augus... View Details Bookmark Cashier - #270007 Student Accounts SHRA Position Library 09/10/2026 No Support Services Associate The primary location of this position is on-site in Cullowhee, NC. This position is designated as being subject to the State of North Carolina Human Resources Act (SHRA).This position provides front-line cashiering and administrative support for the Bursar’s, Controller’s, and Student Accounts Offices. The role is responsible for processing departmental payments, balancing daily receipts, suppo... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Faculty - College of Business Office of the Dean, Business Adjunct Yes Adjunct Faculty The College of Business commonly, but not always, has the need for part-time instructors. We invite applications to be submitted for these potential openings.Applications are continually invited for part-time instructors in The College of Business.The College of Business encompasses programs in:AccountingFinanceEconomicsBusiness AdministrationBusiness LawSport ManagementHospitality and TourismQ... View Details Bookmark Purchasing Specialist I - #000202 Purchasing & Accounts Payable EHRA Non Faculty Position Library Yes Purchasing Specialist I The primary location of this position is the main Cullowhee, NC campus.Position will be responsible for the procurement of goods and services in accordance with the state of North Caroline Procurement Regulations and Western Carolina University policies and procedures. Procurement process involves significant work with an automated purchasing system.Must have knowledge of generally accepted pur... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 Next To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
